{"page_id": "olmo_long_tiny_text-11_pg186_pg1-p1", "markdown": "# QUE\n\nQUERK. (1) To grunt; to moan.\n\nWest.\n\n(2) A moulding in joinery. North.\n\nQUERKEN.\n\nTo stifle, or choke.\n\nNorth.\n\n\" Chekenyd or qwerkenyd,\" Pr. Parv.\n\nIt wil grow in the ventricle to such a masse that It wil at the recelt of any hot moisture send up such an ascending fome that it wil be ready to quirken and stifle us.\n\nOptick Glasse of Humors, 1639, p. 124.\n\nQUERN. (1) Corn.\n\nSalop.\n\n(2) A mill.\n\nThis word is generally applied to a\n\nhand-mill.\n\n（A.-S）\n\n\" Mola, a qwernstone,\"\n\nNominale MS.\n\nHaving therefore groond eight bushels of good malt upon our querne, where the toll is saved, she addeth unto It halfe a bushell of wheat meale.\n\nHarrison's Description of England, p. 169.\n\nQUERPO.\n\nSame as Cuerpo, q. v.\n\n\" Me must\n\nden valke in quirpo,\" Nabbes' Bride, 4to. Lond.\n\n1640, sig.B.IV、\n\nA batt, who nigh in quergo sat, Lay snug, and heard the whole debate.\n\nCollins' Miscellanica, 1762, p. 132.\n\nQUERROUR. A worker in a quarry.\n\nQUERT.\n\nJoyful. Also, joy.\n\nIn quert, joyful,\n\nin good spirits.\n\nSee Lydgate, pp. 32, 38 ;\n\nRitson's Met. Rom. iii. 408-9.\n\nRemembyr thy God while thou art quert.\n\nMS. Lawd. 416， （.76.\n\nAnd that hym byhoveth leve hyt in querte, And be overcomen and caste to helle pytt.\n\nMS. Cantab. Ff. ii.3B, f.14.\n\nBut thouge that Noe was in quert, He was not al in ese of hert.\n\nCursor Mundi, MS. Coll. Trin, Cantab. f. 12.\n\nQUEST. (1) The sides of an oven.\n\nPies are\n\nsaid to be quested when their sides have been crushed by each other, or so joined to them as thence to be less baked.\n\nNorth.\n\n(2) To give tongue as hounds do on trail.\n\n\" To\n\nbay or quest as a dog,\" Florio, p. 1.\n\nStill in\n\nuse.\n\nSee Forby, ii. 268.\n\nKenettes questede to quelle, Al so breme so any belle,\n\nThe deer daunteden In the delle, That al the downe denede.\n\n- The growing plants which are reared or set for a hedge. Var. dial\n- Sharp ; piercing.\n\nReliq. Antiq. il. 7.\n\n(3) An inquest.\n\nVar. dial. Both words are\n\nused by Hall, Henry VIII. fr. 50, 53.\n\nQUESTANT. A candidate; one who is seeking for some object.\n\nShak.\n\nQUESTE.\n\nA prayer, or demand. (4.-N.)\n\nQUESTEROUN\n\nCooks, or scullions.\n\n- To revive. Still in use.\n- To conceive with child.\n\nQUEST HOUSE.\n\nThe chief watch-house of a\n\nparish, gencrally adjoining a church, where sometimes quests concerning misdemeanours and annoyances were held.\n\nThe quest-house\n\nis frequently mentioned in the accounts of St. Giles, Cripplegate, 1571, MS. Addit. 12222.\n\nQUESTMEN.\n\n« Those that are yearly chosen,\n\naccording to the custom of a parish, to assist the churchwardens in the enquiry, and presenting such offenders to the ordinary as are punishable in the court-christian,\" Blount's Glossographia, ed. 1681, p. 594.\n\nQUESTMONGER.\n\nA juryman.\n\nAwake, awake, ye questmongers, and take heed you give a truc, just, and right verdict.\n\nBecon's Works, p. 370.\n\n658\n\nQUI\n\nQUESTUARY. Profitable.\n\nQUETE.\n\nWheat.\n\nIt is the translation of\n\nfrumentum in MS. Lansd. 560, f. 45.\n\nThat gere shalbe litulle qwete, And plenté shalbe of appuls grote.\n\nMS. Cantab. Ff. v. 48, f. 75.\n\nQUETHE. (1) Harm ; mischief.\n\n（A.-S.）\n\n(2) To say; to declare.\n\n（4.-S.）\n\n(3) To bequeath.\n\nLydgate.\n\nHous and rente and outher thyng Mow they quethe at here endyng.\n\nSrS. Harl. 1701, f. 42.\n\n(4) Cry; clamour.\n\nGawayne.\n\nQUETHING.\n\nSaying, crying?\n\nBeing alive and seinge I peryshe, i. beinge quycke and quethyng I am undone.\n\nPalsgrave's Acolastus, 1540.\n\nQUETHUN. Whence.\n\nRobson.\n\nQUETOURE.\n\nA scab, or swelling.\n\nQUEVER. Cold.\n\nGay; lively.\n\nWest.\n\nQUEW.\n\nQUEZZEN.\n\nTo suffocate. East.\n\nQUHILLES.\n\nWhilst.\n\nQwhylles he es qwykkeand in qwerte unquellyde with Be he never mo savede ne socourede with Cryste.\n\nMorte Arthure, MS. Lincoin, f. 93.\n\nQUIB.\n\nA taunt, or mock.\n\nColes.\n\nQUIBIBES. Cubebs, \" Quiperium, a quybybe,\"\n\nNominale MS.\n\nQUIBLIN.\n\nAn attempt to deceive.\n\nQUICE.\n\nA wood-pigeon.\n\nGlouc.\n\nQUICK. (a) Aive living.\n\nIn thilke time men hem tok With juggement withouten Ics, And also quie dolven hes.\n\nArthour and Merlin, p. 8.\n\nSir, he seid, asay of this,\n\nThei were jisturday qwyk i-wysse.\n\nMS. Cantab, Ff. v. 48, f. 50.\n\nQuk? ye, forsothe, quyk it was, As wel I may tel you all the case.\n\nThe Sacrifice of Abraham, p. 18.\n\nQUICK-DEER.\n\nDeer with young.\n\nQUICKEN. (1) Couch grass.\n\nNorth.\n\n(2) To work with yeast.\n\nQuickening-dish, the\n\nyeast or balm that is put to new drink to make it work. North.\n\nQUICKER.\n\nA quickset hedge.\n\nWest.\n\nQUICKLINGS.\n\nYoung insects.\n\nEast.\n\nQUICKMIRE. A quagmire.\n\nDevon.\n\nQUICKWOOD.\n\nThorns.\n\nYorksh.\n\nQUID. (1) The cud.\n\nVar. dial.\n\nHence, gene-\n\nrally, to suck one's tongue.\n\n(2) A mouthful of tobacco.\n\nVar. dial.\n\nQUIDDITY\n\nA subtlety; a subtle quirk or\n\npretence. Quiddit was also used.\n\nQUIERIE.\n\nA royal stable.\n\nQUIET.\n\nGentlemanly.\n\nWest.\n\nQUIETUS.\n\nThe official discharge of an account.\n\n(Lat.)\n\nIt is chiefly used metaphorically, and", "width": 987, "height": 1612, "blocks": [{"kind": "heading", "text": "QUE", "bbox": {"x": 228.28571419415582, "y": 70.52499987787883, "width": 60.428571428571416, "height": 26.86666666666657}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUERK. (1) To grunt; to moan.", "bbox": {"x": 50.35714270840868, "y": 114.1833333184546, "width": 302.14285714285717, "height": 23.50833333333343}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "West.", "bbox": {"x": 369.28571411785714, "y": 110.8249999280357, "width": 60.42857142857144, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(2) A moulding in joinery. North.", "bbox": {"x": 50.092735004048066, "y": 133.4950578763602, "width": 322.76224354335244, "height": 27.92526728312179}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUERKEN.", "bbox": {"x": 49.620421573097715, "y": 156.11562856587645, "width": 115.09638949802941, "height": 25.875639402866472}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "To stifle, or choke.", "bbox": {"x": 194.3732579608031, "y": 153.8695491688239, "width": 198.71015194484167, "height": 25.970458602905346}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "North.", "bbox": {"x": 419.64285698487396, "y": 154.48333328394605, "width": 60.42857142857139, "height": 16.791666666666607}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "\" Chekenyd or qwerkenyd,\" Pr. Parv.", "bbox": {"x": 70.13236736474474, "y": 171.79074417150483, "width": 349.8214983258929, "height": 33.84152673085547}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "It wil grow in the ventricle to such a masse that It wil at the recelt of any hot moisture send up such an ascending fome that it wil be ready to quirken and stifle us.", "bbox": {"x": 72.65248433466584, "y": 193.8939825053774, "width": 411.93551826477056, "height": 85.98099240461983}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Optick Glasse of Humors, 1639, p. 124.", "bbox": {"x": 191.35714459166667, "y": 251.8749996081944, "width": 292.07142857142856, "height": 23.50833333333343}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUERN. (1) Corn.", "bbox": {"x": 53.71428560238094, "y": 278.74166661069455, "width": 181.2857142857143, "height": 23.50833333333325}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Salop.", "bbox": {"x": 245.07142832727277, "y": 278.7416665750758, "width": 60.42857142857144, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(2) A mill.", "bbox": {"x": 53.083870510509215, "y": 300.97352939502747, "width": 102.27133641924178, "height": 25.567401337623632}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "This word is generally applied to a", "bbox": {"x": 170.89283627752548, "y": 292.88763564613436, "width": 316.2763998849051, "height": 32.02770177920658}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "hand-mill.", "bbox": {"x": 73.77194831412672, "y": 318.6708696748446, "width": 100.88467597961426, "height": 24.249926737944367}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "（A.-S）", "bbox": {"x": 191.31596345739354, "y": 318.9175012948269, "width": 70.58235849652972, "height": 23.75666384299595}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "\" Mola, a qwernstone,\"", "bbox": {"x": 261.4178682578227, "y": 311.8701551037423, "width": 226.1616052900042, "height": 31.52111381689712}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Nominale MS.", "bbox": {"x": 76.73022858203687, "y": 342.88056130780944, "width": 128.53525733947754, "height": 22.727422893047333}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Having therefore groond eight bushels of good malt upon our querne, where the toll is saved, she addeth unto It halfe a bushell of wheat meale.", "bbox": {"x": 79.30046130717868, "y": 356.37916193451684, "width": 411.6160093035017, "height": 68.03904942671451}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Harrison's Description of England, p. 169.", "bbox": {"x": 164.18606068551392, "y": 415.64543200570273, "width": 322.97393471854076, "height": 27.650850323835986}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUERPO.", "bbox": {"x": 60.42857129268708, "y": 443.29999994402783, "width": 90.64285714285714, "height": 23.50833333333325}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Same as Cuerpo, q. v.", "bbox": {"x": 171.21428567756698, "y": 439.9416666351823, "width": 204.7857142857143, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "\" Me must", "bbox": {"x": 389.42857126071425, "y": 436.58333329735115, "width": 100.71428571428572, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "den valke in quirpo,\" Nabbes' Bride, 4to. Lond.", "bbox": {"x": 79.92182060776211, "y": 450.9393393229206, "width": 410.74665396554127, "height": 41.946922918160816}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "1640, sig.B.IV、", "bbox": {"x": 80.57142845566506, "y": 486.958333298592, "width": 141, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "A batt, who nigh in quergo sat, Lay snug, and heard the whole debate.", "bbox": {"x": 116.76210104020714, "y": 502.11922920283047, "width": 306.5407445090157, "height": 45.98708782593421}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Collins' Miscellanica, 1762, p. 132.", "bbox": {"x": 231.6428573690994, "y": 540.6916666228624, "width": 258.49999999999994, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUERROUR. A worker in a quarry.", "bbox": {"x": 60.10913063182588, "y": 558.3459584927062, "width": 346.3114972795759, "height": 29.749810258547406}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUERT.", "bbox": {"x": 60.400211295110665, "y": 587.6066065349075, "width": 83.98529134477886, "height": 23.71178682247799}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Joyful. Also, joy.", "bbox": {"x": 154.42857121875, "y": 584.3499999265366, "width": 174.57142857142856, "height": 23.50833333333325}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "In quert, joyful,", "bbox": {"x": 345.7857153348214, "y": 580.9916664147918, "width": 144.35714285714286, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "in good spirits.", "bbox": {"x": 79.65208376227396, "y": 602.6606649605044, "width": 159.49011639186315, "height": 31.48566891352337}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "See Lydgate, pp. 32, 38 ;", "bbox": {"x": 248.42857173466385, "y": 604.4999999407355, "width": 245.07142857142858, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Ritson's Met. Rom. iii. 408-9.", "bbox": {"x": 83.496235544548, "y": 624.3123998890235, "width": 272.6432500566755, "height": 28.406824103991095}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Remembyr thy God while thou art quert.", "bbox": {"x": 100.44112606760042, "y": 645.9200072829618, "width": 326.22721699305947, "height": 27.024855601787603}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "MS. Lawd. 416， （.76.", "bbox": {"x": 335.71428575625004, "y": 664.949999949625, "width": 157.78571428571425, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "And that hym byhoveth leve hyt in querte, And be overcomen and caste to helle pytt.", "bbox": {"x": 99.8942304933291, "y": 683.8411491558301, "width": 340.61603137425016, "height": 46.98557911316548}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "MS. Cantab. Ff. ii.3B, f.14.", "bbox": {"x": 285.35714284631337, "y": 722.0416666341665, "width": 208.14285714285717, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "But thouge that Noe was in quert, He was not al in ese of hert.", "bbox": {"x": 140.9999998342676, "y": 748.9083333146996, "width": 268.57142857142856, "height": 40.30000000000003}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Cursor Mundi, MS. Coll. Trin, Cantab. f. 12.", "bbox": {"x": 150.43422354285403, "y": 779.141888953979, "width": 346.97459139142717, "height": 34.52880299091339}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUEST. (1) The sides of an oven.", "bbox": {"x": 70.49999991877878, "y": 809.3583333170834, "width": 329, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Pies are", "bbox": {"x": 412.7349660499678, "y": 801.8015131975224, "width": 84.31578186580116, "height": 21.83030764857947}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "said to be quested when their sides have been crushed by each other, or so joined to them as thence to be less baked.", "bbox": {"x": 88.65963551107941, "y": 821.741206556547, "width": 412.6397596086774, "height": 78.14238100846603}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "North.", "bbox": {"x": 325.6428569645089, "y": 869.8083332703645, "width": 63.7857142857143, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(2) To give tongue as hounds do on trail.", "bbox": {"x": 66.72261134698985, "y": 889.3761378745507, "width": 373.5103171212333, "height": 32.62992724577583}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "\" To", "bbox": {"x": 443.1428569645089, "y": 889.9583332808593, "width": 57.07142857142853, "height": 16.791666666666785}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "bay or quest as a dog,\" Florio, p. 1.", "bbox": {"x": 86.91452396147845, "y": 908.064808462465, "width": 329.6252125331334, "height": 33.52677265803031}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Still in", "bbox": {"x": 416.2857140568181, "y": 910.1083332417423, "width": 83.92857142857142, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "use.", "bbox": {"x": 90.64285695634922, "y": 943.6916665733796, "width": 40.28571428571428, "height": 16.791666666666607}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "See Forby, ii. 268.", "bbox": {"x": 147.71428564482758, "y": 936.9749999594683, "width": 167.8571428571429, "height": 23.50833333333325}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Kenettes questede to quelle, Al so breme so any belle,", "bbox": {"x": 146.9919523332288, "y": 956.0092540333926, "width": 219.6242411477225, "height": 44.77141603628792}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "The deer daunteden In the delle, That al the downe denede.", "bbox": {"x": 150.73003790269937, "y": 993.3089185861141, "width": 255.86082703726632, "height": 42.818152685960015}}, {"kind": "list", "text": "The growing plants which are reared or set for a hedge. Var. dial Sharp ; piercing.", "bbox": {"x": 516.5531279950676, "y": 1009.5124980505578, "width": 424.30638939993713, "height": 76.36615481376658}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Reliq. Antiq. il. 7.", "bbox": {"x": 359.2142855423345, "y": 1031.00833330876, "width": 141.00000000000006, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(3) An inquest.", "bbox": {"x": 73.2643906508176, "y": 1055.736230993733, "width": 155.39146532331193, "height": 26.486038303375135}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Var. dial. Both words are", "bbox": {"x": 231.1319152315782, "y": 1046.4435610410783, "width": 272.96356582641596, "height": 33.35726037820183}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "used by Hall, Henry VIII. fr. 50, 53.", "bbox": {"x": 93.41801712518844, "y": 1068.5392044341952, "width": 330.1427993774414, "height": 35.03379758199062}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUESTANT. A candidate; one who is seeking for some object.", "bbox": {"x": 73.22512388170753, "y": 1089.1619487128594, "width": 431.12246104649137, "height": 54.88023073673245}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Shak.", "bbox": {"x": 248.42857128309527, "y": 1121.683333277361, "width": 57.07142857142858, "height": 16.791666666666785}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUESTE.", "bbox": {"x": 73.66213515349943, "y": 1144.2020734017847, "width": 97.74715791429792, "height": 22.129186459382293}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "A prayer, or demand. (4.-N.)", "bbox": {"x": 180.88527046390766, "y": 1136.8988755099808, "width": 276.1794275556292, "height": 29.81863428751629}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUESTEROUN", "bbox": {"x": 80.13171527508604, "y": 1163.9382879518803, "width": 141.84801973615376, "height": 21.98277085622147}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Cooks, or scullions.", "bbox": {"x": 241.71428555314284, "y": 1161.9833333131833, "width": 181.2857142857143, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "list", "text": "To revive. Still in use. To conceive with child.", "bbox": {"x": 519.4108422064083, "y": 1181.1994978620085, "width": 246.79803712027413, "height": 52.988410663604704}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUEST HOUSE.", "bbox": {"x": 80.12585138210434, "y": 1184.2052602112676, "width": 158.48936653137207, "height": 22.124842721223686}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "The chief watch-house of a", "bbox": {"x": 237.9397711089992, "y": 1178.076104220819, "width": 269.30273001534607, "height": 27.173452281952013}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "parish, gencrally adjoining a church, where sometimes quests concerning misdemeanours and annoyances were held.", "bbox": {"x": 95.944722598741, "y": 1200.0737178261516, "width": 412.40616934640065, "height": 76.06646330356594}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "The quest-house", "bbox": {"x": 359.2142855464285, "y": 1245.9416666386803, "width": 147.71428571428572, "height": 23.50833333333343}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "is frequently mentioned in the accounts of St. Giles, Cripplegate, 1571, MS. Addit. 12222.", "bbox": {"x": 96.7348133879947, "y": 1262.0408889832945, "width": 411.5799206324986, "height": 59.4207942803701}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUESTMEN.", "bbox": {"x": 80.13618612062703, "y": 1313.679165996681, "width": 128.01687649318148, "height": 25.127280175685883}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "« Those that are yearly chosen,", "bbox": {"x": 224.72203341117657, "y": 1308.8218093669007, "width": 279.04006304059703, "height": 24.331625847021893}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "according to the custom of a parish, to assist the churchwardens in the enquiry, and presenting such offenders to the ordinary as are punishable in the court-christian,\" Blount's Glossographia, ed. 1681, p. 594.", "bbox": {"x": 98.02941336145393, "y": 1327.723110843019, "width": 415.275526046753, "height": 122.43754719098408}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUESTMONGER.", "bbox": {"x": 83.3246512601326, "y": 1439.0531742232092, "width": 175.50666046142578, "height": 29.377550697326733}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "A juryman.", "bbox": {"x": 265.21428555725805, "y": 1444.0833333008334, "width": 117.50000000000001, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Awake, awake, ye questmongers, and take heed you give a truc, just, and right verdict.", "bbox": {"x": 103.23129446257612, "y": 1457.6118526839339, "width": 411.1773103986468, "height": 50.660021285215954}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Becon's Works, p. 370.", "bbox": {"x": 342.4285713635945, "y": 1497.8166666341667, "width": 167.8571428571429, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "658", "bbox": {"x": 463.2857141178572, "y": 67.16666657071437, "width": 47.00000000000005, "height": 26.86666666666657}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUI", "bbox": {"x": 684.8571426892858, "y": 63.80833325497217, "width": 57.07142857142853, "height": 23.50833333333343}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUESTUARY. Profitable.", "bbox": {"x": 486.5665204428558, "y": 102.13472394318305, "width": 262.272329057966, "height": 25.875503285725898}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUETE.", "bbox": {"x": 496.7610693472099, "y": 127.20839818824037, "width": 84.12071990966795, "height": 20.966536299387627}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Wheat.", "bbox": {"x": 597.5714284035715, "y": 127.61666662002322, "width": 73.85714285714283, "height": 16.791666666666607}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "It is the translation of", "bbox": {"x": 694.4356753418259, "y": 117.06229557581479, "width": 236.1610358101981, "height": 30.603018116950953}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "frumentum in MS. Lansd. 560, f. 45.", "bbox": {"x": 513.3388567456732, "y": 143.20407939809124, "width": 339.5817669459752, "height": 28.37225995858509}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "That gere shalbe litulle qwete, And plenté shalbe of appuls grote.", "bbox": {"x": 573.4313008806222, "y": 168.36543283553206, "width": 272.80499594552174, "height": 44.230909283955846}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "MS. Cantab. Ff. v. 48, f. 75.", "bbox": {"x": 711.1384739550513, "y": 203.5631750514219, "width": 215.92850766863157, "height": 26.967905791600568}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUETHE. (1) Harm ; mischief.", "bbox": {"x": 499.98502375988176, "y": 231.08231632605577, "width": 295.8713427952358, "height": 27.00213364760075}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "（A.-S.）", "bbox": {"x": 812.4285713086734, "y": 228.3666665947023, "width": 67.14285714285722, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(2) To say; to declare.", "bbox": {"x": 500.2142855505226, "y": 255.23333330466463, "width": 208.14285714285717, "height": 23.50833333333343}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "（4.-S.）", "bbox": {"x": 721.7857145654763, "y": 251.8749996081944, "width": 70.49999999999997, "height": 23.50833333333343}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(3) To bequeath.", "bbox": {"x": 500.21428554642864, "y": 278.74166663933136, "width": 157.78571428571425, "height": 23.50833333333343}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Lydgate.", "bbox": {"x": 668.0714283476191, "y": 275.3833329975001, "width": 87.28571428571428, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Hous and rente and outher thyng Mow they quethe at here endyng.", "bbox": {"x": 576.74222026363, "y": 293.6810127105831, "width": 263.2222243717739, "height": 44.2225452860197}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "SrS. Harl. 1701, f. 42.", "bbox": {"x": 754.9197044775777, "y": 328.65576861486284, "width": 175.38159234183178, "height": 25.458084060748405}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(4) Cry; clamour.", "bbox": {"x": 503.5714283364286, "y": 355.9833332745626, "width": 167.85714285714283, "height": 23.50833333333325}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Gawayne.", "bbox": {"x": 688.2142855394344, "y": 355.9833332913541, "width": 90.64285714285714, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUETHING.", "bbox": {"x": 503.5714283939795, "y": 379.491666637881, "width": 124.21428571428574, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Saying, crying?", "bbox": {"x": 640.9986466188496, "y": 375.2037036681095, "width": 145.2799268450056, "height": 27.993024794260638}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Being alive and seinge I peryshe, i. beinge quycke and quethyng I am undone.", "bbox": {"x": 526.5879714263214, "y": 392.3205823526019, "width": 407.3574436732701, "height": 50.07318185965229}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Palsgrave's Acolastus, 1540.", "bbox": {"x": 715.0714290750001, "y": 433.2249999225, "width": 218.21428571428575, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUETHUN. Whence.", "bbox": {"x": 503.1358417819881, "y": 453.3807069915087, "width": 218.935188293457, "height": 27.258631185690394}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Robson.", "bbox": {"x": 731.8571426118133, "y": 456.7333332687501, "width": 77.2142857142857, "height": 16.791666666666785}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUETOURE.", "bbox": {"x": 506.928571266129, "y": 480.24166663416673, "width": 127.5714285714286, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "A scab, or swelling.", "bbox": {"x": 650.9287215874706, "y": 473.7423027385478, "width": 171.989026750837, "height": 26.93353060881291}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUEVER. Cold.", "bbox": {"x": 502.80174762760186, "y": 481.9617914739385, "width": 154.379432950701, "height": 72.26150240898126}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Gay; lively.", "bbox": {"x": 614.3571426593112, "y": 500.3916666246876, "width": 124.21428571428564, "height": 23.50833333333325}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "West.", "bbox": {"x": 745.0329262637783, "y": 497.45582978746745, "width": 64.37027903965537, "height": 21.63608370224629}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUEW.", "bbox": {"x": 506.92857130547617, "y": 523.8999999216389, "width": 77.2142857142857, "height": 23.50833333333325}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUEZZEN.", "bbox": {"x": 506.62661189220876, "y": 544.9293422687226, "width": 104.79333645956852, "height": 21.341931358973017}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "To suffocate. East.", "bbox": {"x": 627.785714691369, "y": 540.6916665687153, "width": 191.35714285714286, "height": 23.50833333333325}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUHILLES.", "bbox": {"x": 506.92857125562773, "y": 567.5583333028031, "width": 120.85714285714288, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Whilst.", "bbox": {"x": 634.5000001678571, "y": 564.1999996641667, "width": 77.2142857142857, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Qwhylles he es qwykkeand in qwerte unquellyde with Be he never mo savede ne socourede with Cryste.", "bbox": {"x": 526.0355308282392, "y": 580.6933557032886, "width": 411.70533452715193, "height": 67.58970913092293}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Morte Arthure, MS. Lincoin, f. 93.", "bbox": {"x": 671.4285736946428, "y": 638.0833330394793, "width": 268.57142857142867, "height": 23.50833333333325}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUIB.", "bbox": {"x": 510.2857141483767, "y": 668.3083332264772, "width": 63.78571428571425, "height": 23.50833333333343}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "A taunt, or mock.", "bbox": {"x": 587.0948256621616, "y": 664.54268692699, "width": 161.99313082013805, "height": 25.960198573271516}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Coles.", "bbox": {"x": 765.4285712149351, "y": 664.949999908409, "width": 60.428571428571495, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUIBIBES. Cubebs, \" Quiperium, a quybybe,\"", "bbox": {"x": 509.65080035741335, "y": 677.8800361419206, "width": 431.19743020193926, "height": 41.7031915664675}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Nominale MS.", "bbox": {"x": 530.4285712562969, "y": 711.9666666401534, "width": 130.92857142857147, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUIBLIN.", "bbox": {"x": 510.2510533639151, "y": 735.294292449128, "width": 104.14075006757467, "height": 20.51141502857219}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "An attempt to deceive.", "bbox": {"x": 627.1586208774281, "y": 725.7041506845591, "width": 202.7840993063791, "height": 31.948521637916492}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUICE.", "bbox": {"x": 510.25776715300015, "y": 755.517299265851, "width": 77.27017961229593, "height": 20.365401371319898}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "A wood-pigeon.", "bbox": {"x": 594.2142855464286, "y": 755.6249999754269, "width": 157.78571428571425, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Glouc.", "bbox": {"x": 768.5247194301069, "y": 749.7847832702128, "width": 64.58036300114225, "height": 21.295150299867053}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUICK. (a) Aive living.", "bbox": {"x": 506.2167711469748, "y": 772.7337425604142, "width": 246.0914649963379, "height": 53.72538889646527}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "In thilke time men hem tok With juggement withouten Ics, And also quie dolven hes.", "bbox": {"x": 606.2254974645733, "y": 813.4504449875816, "width": 247.34156990051272, "height": 65.80045732657112}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Arthour and Merlin, p. 8.", "bbox": {"x": 735.214285662996, "y": 873.1666666386805, "width": 204.7857142857142, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Sir, he seid, asay of this,", "bbox": {"x": 610.6187023134406, "y": 892.1758392818266, "width": 198.72481536865243, "height": 24.342279815673756}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Thei were jisturday qwyk i-wysse.", "bbox": {"x": 610.5615425948847, "y": 908.3572165472119, "width": 262.5884955269949, "height": 27.319180893898046}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "MS. Cantab, Ff. v. 48, f. 50.", "bbox": {"x": 728.4999998468672, "y": 930.258333315658, "width": 214.8571428571429, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Quk? ye, forsothe, quyk it was, As wel I may tel you all the case.", "bbox": {"x": 589.9028449746547, "y": 951.2130098460202, "width": 263.57564490182057, "height": 45.82787561019257}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "The Sacrifice of Abraham, p. 18.", "bbox": {"x": 708.3571441520407, "y": 990.7083331894047, "width": 235.00000000000003, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUICK-DEER.", "bbox": {"x": 516.1209112691124, "y": 1075.601459371797, "width": 145.88690294538222, "height": 30.044969868660118}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Deer with young.", "bbox": {"x": 674.7857139997354, "y": 1078.0249999626853, "width": 161.1428571428571, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUICKEN. (1) Couch grass.", "bbox": {"x": 516.9999999160715, "y": 1101.533333309825, "width": 258.49999999999994, "height": 23.50833333333343}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "North.", "bbox": {"x": 788.9285712607143, "y": 1098.1749999407352, "width": 63.78571428571425, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(2) To work with yeast.", "bbox": {"x": 516.6558050670551, "y": 1121.394905952701, "width": 222.2498392377581, "height": 26.864669748147247}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Quickening-dish, the", "bbox": {"x": 755.3571429041428, "y": 1118.3249999596999, "width": 191.35714285714286, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "yeast or balm that is put to new drink to make it work. North.", "bbox": {"x": 539.7661977704973, "y": 1135.5774859765677, "width": 407.8465104784284, "height": 52.38125775655109}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUICKER.", "bbox": {"x": 520.1620295007551, "y": 1231.5811009329843, "width": 107.81879779270712, "height": 25.362798058986773}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "A quickset hedge.", "bbox": {"x": 630.683943821256, "y": 1225.3911308579457, "width": 178.8802724565778, "height": 28.786155351003107}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "West.", "bbox": {"x": 808.9942822064095, "y": 1225.518142402884, "width": 70.65429251534599, "height": 20.69704838196438}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUICKLINGS.", "bbox": {"x": 519.8674631832879, "y": 1249.9090004191492, "width": 148.54806464059007, "height": 26.6857317566872}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Young insects.", "bbox": {"x": 674.58776451277, "y": 1249.1761877993001, "width": 138.038756779262, "height": 23.75595763524358}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "East.", "bbox": {"x": 829.2142875948581, "y": 1245.9416663308336, "width": 50.35713965552206, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUICKMIRE. A quagmire.", "bbox": {"x": 520.3571428142027, "y": 1272.808333305998, "width": 265.21428571428567, "height": 23.50833333333343}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Devon.", "bbox": {"x": 798.9999994292857, "y": 1269.4499997985, "width": 70.49999999999997, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUICKWOOD.", "bbox": {"x": 520.0564065879055, "y": 1293.9149383930196, "width": 148.13687406267437, "height": 24.869789783159938}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Thorns.", "bbox": {"x": 681.4999998241497, "y": 1296.3166666266866, "width": 73.85714285714283, "height": 16.791666666666607}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Yorksh.", "bbox": {"x": 768.7857141178571, "y": 1292.9583332773611, "width": 73.85714285714293, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUID. (1) The cud.", "bbox": {"x": 523.3033779944768, "y": 1316.12552023748, "width": 182.07258306230818, "height": 25.83623589277282}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Var. dial.", "bbox": {"x": 725.1428571733766, "y": 1313.1083332417425, "width": 87.28571428571438, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Hence, gene-", "bbox": {"x": 815.785714127731, "y": 1313.1083332987623, "width": 134.28571428571433, "height": 23.50833333333325}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "rally, to suck one's tongue.", "bbox": {"x": 539.9140976004226, "y": 1335.183491058693, "width": 239.54176821027482, "height": 30.092380269368476}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(2) A mouthful of tobacco.", "bbox": {"x": 523.2584602863398, "y": 1357.9924489005155, "width": 245.81840515136716, "height": 27.24289604425441}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Var. dial.", "bbox": {"x": 782.2142855464286, "y": 1356.7666666263667, "width": 90.64285714285714, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUIDDITY", "bbox": {"x": 523.2458915717269, "y": 1383.4717243771213, "width": 115.06254196166996, "height": 23.352397537231337}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "A subtlety; a subtle quirk or", "bbox": {"x": 647.6196702210207, "y": 1375.8682639324295, "width": 306.1071553911482, "height": 28.281477832794117}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "pretence. Quiddit was also used.", "bbox": {"x": 543.3111807126681, "y": 1398.4843715358156, "width": 306.46414893014094, "height": 29.248875161012073}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUIERIE.", "bbox": {"x": 523.7142855344387, "y": 1427.2916666306844, "width": 107.42857142857144, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "A royal stable.", "bbox": {"x": 633.7668893083261, "y": 1420.7263296634453, "width": 139.0683468409947, "height": 28.944525241851807}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUIET.", "bbox": {"x": 522.6300699720515, "y": 1444.7497724625414, "width": 89.14063739776613, "height": 27.232555945714374}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Gentlemanly.", "bbox": {"x": 610.999999832143, "y": 1447.4416666361365, "width": 130.92857142857136, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "West.", "bbox": {"x": 755.3571423116072, "y": 1440.724999706146, "width": 57.07142857142853, "height": 23.50833333333325}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "QUIETUS.", "bbox": {"x": 526.996168905837, "y": 1467.2646937794618, "width": 100.86480672018875, "height": 24.162278509139906}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "The official discharge of an account.", "bbox": {"x": 637.4900351264216, "y": 1461.4382102100521, "width": 316.3398944309779, "height": 30.537050946553535}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(Lat.)", "bbox": {"x": 543.8571426892858, "y": 1494.4583332740688, "width": 63.785714285714356, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "It is chiefly used metaphorically, and", "bbox": {"x": 610.6671636500986, "y": 1483.124358544462, "width": 343.1691447666713, "height": 30.222860558827705}}], "ms": 333.223958}